Use `alt=\"\"` on the Image and `aria-hidden=\"true\"` on the Avatar when the entire avatar is purely decorative."},"112":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-24","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#accessibility","content":"Give an Avatar Button or Account Menu an accessible name with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`."},"113":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-25","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#accessibility","content":"When using `Pressable`, provide an interactive role for the non-semantic Avatar child."},"114":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-26","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#best-practices","content":"Use Avatar for informational identity; compose it with `Pressable` for an Avatar Button or Account Menu when it is independently actionable."},"115":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-27","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#best-practices","content":"Use circle for people and square for businesses, workspaces, and accounts."},"116":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-28","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#best-practices","content":"Keep monograms to one or two uppercase characters."},"117":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-29","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#best-practices","content":"Use the same `figure*` emphasis for the same entity wherever it appears."},"118":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-30","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#troubleshooting","content":"If an image is unavailable because of a bad URL or CORS policy, Text remains visible."},"119":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-31","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar#troubleshooting"