ally beneficial with many repeated icons"],[236,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[764,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[240,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1535,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[758,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1140,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[680,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[745,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[762,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[755,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1171,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1170,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[915,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1326,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[869,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[746,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[741,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[216,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[247,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1647,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[221,"**RTL support**: Full right-to