nter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1297,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[740,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[750,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1393,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[1006,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[250,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[239,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[690,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[734,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[375,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1173,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1295,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1565,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1563,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1564,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1142,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1623,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1622,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[254,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[243,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[749,"**Trade-offs:**"],[691,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[1319,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[948,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[851,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[223,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[685,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[891,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[752,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[753,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[763,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[1010,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1323,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1536,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1008,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[272,"**Verify