matOptions`"],[839,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[856,"`BoxContext` supplies default props to Boxes in its subtree. A `slots` map supplies defaults to\nnamed parts; each Box selects one with `slot`. Explicit consumer props override defaults, while\nclasses, styles, and refs are merged. Pass `slot={null}` to opt out of the context."],[503,"`Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a native button with `aria-expanded` for its open state and\n`aria-controls` linked to the panel automatically."],[153,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[184,"`CardGroup` uses grid navigation: Tab enters or leaves, arrow keys move between Cards, and Space\nchanges selection. Enter activates row actions or links. Choose selection or `onAction`;\ncombining them prevents pointer selection."],[364,"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."],[425,"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"],[437,"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."],[421,"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"],[430,"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."],[1672,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[498,"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."],[504,"`CollapsiblePanel` is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."],[505,"`CollapsiblePanel` uses `role=\"group\"` by default. Keep it when the panel's content does not need\na navigation landmark; there is no need to set it explicitly."],[500,"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."],[547,"`commitBehavior` on `DateRangePickerCalendar` applies to both presentations."],[1128,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[714,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[717,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[713,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[715,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[716,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[718,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1427,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[1357,"`default`, `full`, and `none` rounding"],[545,"`drawerProps` customizes the drawer, which defaults to `85dvh`; `popoverProps` customizes the popover."],[565,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[635,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[1591,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[622,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."],[868,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[722,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[890,"`Grid` is a two-dimensional CSS Grid layout component for complex grid-based layouts. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[508,"`Icon slot=\"indicator\"` is decorative and receives `aria-hidden=\"true\"` automatically."],[792,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a thin wrapper over RAC `DisclosurePanel` that hides when collapsed. The trigger is any component you slot in with `slot=\"trigger\"` — there's no dedicated trigger component."],[815,"`Input` is the single-line control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` or `NumberField` as the parent; see those components for fuller examples."],[845,"`lg` - Large spacing"],[916,"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."],[844,"`md` - Medium spacing"],[151,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[987,"`ModalTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Modal>`, handling open state automatically. Based on RAC `DialogTrigger`."],[1127,"`orientation` switches between `horizontal` (accent bar on top) and `vertical` (accent bar on the leading edge)."],[1473,"`overflowLabels` is optional and defaults to \"Previous tabs\" and \"Next tabs\". Provide localized labels when needed; they should describe the logical direction rather than physical directions like \"left\" or \"right\", as the component automatically handles RTL layouts."],[1667,"`overlay`